{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49064","headline":"游倚帝山二首 二 · 吴筠","name":"游倚帝山二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"兹山何独秀，万仞倚昊苍。\n晨跻烟霞趾，夕憩灵仙场。\n俯观海上月，坐弄浮云翔。\n松风振雅音，桂露含晴光。\n不出六合外，超然万累忘。\n信彼古来士，岩栖道弥彰。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吴筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49064.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49064","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}